# Rename to .env or .env.local and set your keys for development
# NASA GIBS is used for satellite basemaps (no API key required)
# No client-side Google or Bing keys are required anymore.

# Optional - if your client code needs to call backend endpoints that use these keys server-side,
# add them to the server environment (not the client): set these in your system or in a .env at project root
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here
# BING_MAPS_KEY=your_bing_maps_key_here
